<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Salomon cuts Coca-Cola Enterprises.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Salomon cuts Coca-Cola Enterprises.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said Thursday it cut its rating on Coca-Cola Enterprises Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- cited appreciation in stock price for rating reduction.</p>
<p>-- said price target remains $55 a share.</p>
<p>-- said Coca-Cola Enterprises' acquisitions may effect impact short-term earnings predictability.</p>
<p>-- stock lost 1-1/4 to 47-1/4 in midday trading.</p>
</text>
